The '''Jaluku'''<ref name="Bounty Hunters">''[[Star Wars: Batuu Bounty Hunters]]''</ref> were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that lived in [[the galaxy]] that had [[Color|white]] skin and an elongated chin.<ref name="TROS VD" /> Jaluku lived on worlds such as [[Vandor]]<ref name="Bounty Hunters" /> and [[Daiyu]].<ref name="Obi-Wan Kenobi">{{Kenobi|Part II}}</ref> [[Seleno Chandro]] was a Jaluku [[Gender|male]] [[bounty hunter]] who formerly worked in the [[Bounty Hunters' Guild]] and would later join [[Citizens' Fleet]] during the [[Battle of Exegol]].<ref name="TROS VD" /> Jaluku could be commonly seen wearing [[goggles]] to cover their eyes, Chandro wore [[data goggles]] in particular.

